      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I'M HONEY (5) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a 3 length third over 390m Warrnambool in 22.39. Racing well and deserves a win. FRED'S FURY (7) finished third (22.99) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th at Horsham. Likely to be thereabouts. FIND THE SUN (1) has a strong record this trip with 11 wins and eight placings from 27 starts. Was out of placings last time (20.16) at Traralgon in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 2.5 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. BURN AROUND (2) looks a chance coming off a year layoff.",
